{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人吳若希早前暫別處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》，歸家無期，但依然持續有音樂上的工作。</p><p>她於剛過去的周日，在重慶大劇院演出《飲歌—香港影視流行音樂會（重慶站）》，結束了超過一個月的長假後正式復工。</p><p>工作之餘，來到重慶當然要完成一個「落地簽」的指定</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.474306+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:01:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.625629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.625629+00:00","content_hash":"00b45a5f023cc092d6bd7af159506de593eb832a326d684f333d89801cc72da0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}